@startuml Deployment with Contract Sequence Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title Payment with Contract Sequence

actor "Requester\n(Service Provider)" as Requester
participant "Requester DMS" as ReqDMS
participant "Contract Host\n(Solution Enabler)" as ContractHost
participant "Contract Actor" as ContractActor
database "Contract Database" as ContractDB
actor "Provider\n(Compute Provider)" as Provider
participant "Provider DMS" as ProvDMS
participant "Payment Validator" as PaymentValidator
participant "Blockchain RPC" as MockRPC

== Usage Tracking and Payment Phase ==

group Usage Calculation
    ContractHost -> ContractHost: **ContractUsagesCalculateBehavior**\nCalculate contract usages
    ContractHost -> ContractActor: Request usage data
    ContractActor -> ContractActor: Calculate resource usage
    note right
        Tracks:
        - CPU time
        - Memory usage
        - Duration
    end note
    ContractActor --> ContractHost: Usage metrics
end

group Send Usage to Payment Provider
    ContractHost -> PaymentValidator: **ContractUsageBehavior**\nSend aggregated usages
    note right
        Includes:
        - Unique ID
        - Contract DID
        - Usage amount
    end note
    PaymentValidator -> PaymentValidator: Store usage record
    PaymentValidator --> ContractHost: Usage recorded

    PaymentValidator -> ReqDMS: **ContractTransactionBehavior**\nNotify transaction
    note right
        Transaction details:
        - Unique ID
        - To address (Provider)
        - Amount
        - Status: unpaid
    end note
    ReqDMS -> ReqDMS: Store transaction locally
end

group Payment Confirmation
    Requester -> ReqDMS: **ContractListLocalTransactionsBehavior**\nList local transactions
    ReqDMS -> ReqDMS: Query local transactions
    ReqDMS --> Requester: Transaction list\n(status: unpaid)
    
    Requester -[#blue,bold]-> Requester: <color:blue> <b>Execute blockchain payment</b>
    skinparam NoteBorderColor blue
    skinparam NoteBorderThickness 3
    note right
        <color:blue><b>Off-chain action with wallet interaction via NuNet Appliance:
        <color:blue><b>Requester sends payment via blockchain
        <color:blue><b>and obtains transaction hash
    end note
    skinparam NoteBorderColor black
    skinparam NoteBorderThickness 1

    Requester -> ReqDMS: **ContractConfirmLocalTransactionBehavior**\nConfirm payment\n(unique_id, tx_hash)
    ReqDMS -> ReqDMS: Update transaction status
    ReqDMS -> PaymentValidator: **ContractPaymentValidationRequestBehavior**\nValidate payment\n(unique_id, tx_hash)

    PaymentValidator -> MockRPC: Query transaction\n(tx_hash)
    note right
        RPC validates:
        - Transaction exists
        - Correct addresses
        - Correct amount
    end note
    MockRPC --> PaymentValidator: Transaction details\n(confirmed)

    PaymentValidator -> PaymentValidator: Mark transaction as paid
    PaymentValidator --> ReqDMS: Payment validated
    ReqDMS -> ReqDMS: Update local status: **paid**
    ReqDMS --> Requester: Payment confirmed

    Requester -> ReqDMS: **ContractListLocalTransactionsBehavior**\nList transactions again
    ReqDMS --> Requester: Transaction list\n(status: **paid**)
end

group Payment Status Verification - All Parties
    Requester -> ReqDMS: **ContractPaymentStatusBehavior**\nCheck payment status
    ReqDMS -> PaymentValidator: Query status (unique_id)
    PaymentValidator --> ReqDMS: Paid: **true**
    ReqDMS --> Requester: Payment confirmed

    Provider -> ProvDMS: **ContractPaymentStatusBehavior**\nCheck payment status
    ProvDMS -> PaymentValidator: Query status (unique_id)
    PaymentValidator --> ProvDMS: Paid: **true**
    ProvDMS --> Provider: Payment confirmed

    ContractHost -> PaymentValidator: **ContractPaymentStatusBehavior**\nCheck payment status
    PaymentValidator --> ContractHost: Paid: **true**

    note over Requester, PaymentValidator
        All three parties (Requester, Provider,
        Contract Host) verify payment status
        from Payment Validator
    end note
end

@enduml
